[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120544657","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-3120544657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":3120544657,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65_7uR","user":{"login":"huwpascoe","id":1812087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTIwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1812087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe","html_url":"https://github.com/huwpascoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-25T22:18:07Z","updated_at":"2025-07-25T22:18:07Z","body":"There is a problem with this example, create_tween() is called as self from main.gd which ties their lifetime to main.\n\nThe foo instance should instead create the tween, preferably in foo.gd otherwise via `foo.create_tween()`\n\nSee if that makes a difference.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3120544657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527510000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-3527510000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":3527510000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SQYfw","user":{"login":"nilan256","id":24468033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDY4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24468033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256","html_url":"https://github.com/nilan256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-13T12:06:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-13T12:06:52Z","body":"I seem to have encountered a similar problem, here is a simple case.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nstatic var _self: Node\nstatic var _weakref : WeakRef\n\nclass CheckMemoryFreed:\n\tvar arr: Array\n\tfunc _init() -> void:\n\t\tarr.resize(5000000)\n\t\tprint(\"Obj created\")\n\tfunc _notification(what: int) -> void:\n\t\tif what == NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE:\n\t\t\tprint(\"Obj freed\")\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t_self = self\n\tprint(\"Start\")\n\tprint(\"mem usage: %d mb\" % (OS.get_static_memory_usage() / 1024 / 1024))\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout\n\tprint(\"Calling normal function\")\n\tnormal_function()\n\tprint(\"mem usage: %d mb\" % (OS.get_static_memory_usage() / 1024 / 1024))\n\tprint(\"weakref: %s\" % _weakref.get_ref())\n\t\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout\n\tprint(\"Calling await function\")\n\tprint(\"mem usage: %d mb\" % (OS.get_static_memory_usage() / 1024 / 1024))\n\tawait_function()\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1).timeout\n\tprint(\"Freeing\")\n\tget_tree().create_timer(1).timeout.connect(static_print, CONNECT_ONE_SHOT)\n\tfree()\n\tprint(\"Freed\")\n\n\nstatic func static_print():\n\tprint(\"self: %s\" % _self) \n\tprint(\"mem usage: %d mb\" % (OS.get_static_memory_usage() / 1024 / 1024))\n\tprint(\"weakref: %s\" % _weakref.get_ref())\n\n\nfunc normal_function():\n\tprint(\"--- Begin normal function ---\")\n\tif true:\n\t\tvar obj = CheckMemoryFreed.new()\n\t\t_weakref = weakref(obj)\n\t\tprint(\"mem usage: %d mb\" % (OS.get_static_memory_usage() / 1024 / 1024))\n\t\tprint(\"weakref: %s\" % _weakref.get_ref())\n\tprint(\"--- End normal function ---\")\n\nfunc await_function():\n\tprint(\"--- Begin await function ---\")\n\tif true:\n\t\tvar obj = CheckMemoryFreed.new()\n\t\t_weakref = weakref(obj)\n\t\tprint(\"weakref: %s\" % _weakref.get_ref())\n\t\tprint(\"Awaiting...\")\n\t\tawait renamed\n\t\tprint(\"Await finished\")\n\tprint(\"--- End await function ---\")\n```\n\nhere's the output:\n```\nStart\nmem usage: 87 mb\nCalling normal function\n--- Begin normal function ---\nObj created\nmem usage: 214 mb\nweakref: <RefCounted#-9223371879367046086>\nObj freed\n--- End normal function ---\nmem usage: 86 mb\nweakref: <null>\nCalling await function\nmem usage: 86 mb\n--- Begin await function ---\nObj created\nweakref: <RefCounted#-9223371876280039511>\nAwaiting...\nFreeing\nFreed\nself: <Object#null>\nmem usage: 214 mb\nweakref: <RefCounted#-9223371876280039511>\n```\n\nI'm not sure if the function itself hasn't been freed or if the objects on the stack haven't been freed correctly, and I don't know how to manually clean this memory either.\nThis looks quite dangerous.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3527510000/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3532836595","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-3532836595","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":3532836595,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Sks7z","user":{"login":"huwpascoe","id":1812087,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTIwODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1812087?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe","html_url":"https://github.com/huwpascoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/huwpascoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T13:32:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T13:32:48Z","body":"> I'm not sure if the function itself hasn't been freed or if the objects on the stack haven't been freed correctly, and I don't know how to manually clean this memory either\n\nThe line `await renamed`, who owns renamed, what is it?\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3532836595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3534236937","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-3534236937","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":3534236937,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SqC0J","user":{"login":"pewcworrell","id":101294411,"node_id":"U_kgDOBgmhSw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/101294411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell","html_url":"https://github.com/pewcworrell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pewcworrell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T19:23:39Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T19:23:39Z","body":"Relates to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/74449. We already set it to ignore leaks from coroutines in our engine, but we're recently getting tweens leaking. I guess it makes sense that they're related.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3534236937/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538526773","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-3538526773","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":3538526773,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S6aI1","user":{"login":"nilan256","id":24468033,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDY4MDMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24468033?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256","html_url":"https://github.com/nilan256","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nilan256/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T10:53:21Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T10:56:39Z","body":"> The line `await renamed`, who owns renamed, what is it?\n\nIt's [Node.renamed](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-signal-renamed).\n\nIt doesn't matter what it is, it can be any signal, in this example, what actually happens is that when you `await self.my_signal`, but call `self.free()` before `self.my_signal.emit()`, the local variables in function scope will never be released.\n\nI haven't tried what would happen if I await an external signal, but I guess it would still leak.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538526773/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5560900289","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99383#issuecomment-5560900289","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99383","id":5560900289,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABS3SawQ","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-06T17:25:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-06T17:25:23Z","body":"I came to report this as well, but then I found out I can only repro my own issue in `4.6.3`, but not in `4.7`.\nCould we confirm if this has been fixed, since it has been a while?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5560900289/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]